SUMMARY:Oktoberfest Study Hall
DESCRIPTION:Raise a stein—and maybe a cocktail\, too. Join The Conway Room for an Oktoberfest-inspired Study Hall celebrating the many ways German drinking culture comes to life. We’ll explore Oktoberfest-style beers from around the world while also venturing beyond the beer hall with German-inspired mulled wine and cocktails.  \n\n\n\nThroughout the evening\, you’ll taste\, learn\, and get hands-on with the drinks\, exploring the history\, traditions\, and flavors behind the celebration. And\, as always with Study Hall\, you’ll have the opportunity to build a cocktail yourself. Come hungry\, because the food is part of the fun. Enjoy hearty housemade fare including mini pretzel sliders featuring cured pork belly\, smoked apple jam and sauerkraut\, plus housemade bratwurst with beer cheese espuma and curry mustard. Festive activities will round out the evening\, making this the perfect excuse to gather your friends\, raise a glass\, and embrace a little German gemütlichkeit🍺  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/oktoberfest-study-hall/
LOCATION:The Conway Room\, 28 E King Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Food & Drink
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/IMG_6758-scaled.avif
END:VEVENT
