SUMMARY:All Hallows Flea 3rd Annual Halloween Market
DESCRIPTION:Calling all spooky peeps and Halloween lovin’ fiends! All Hallows Flea is now a two-day event at a new\, bigger location. We’re like the punk rock flea market meets Halloween. Vintage Halloween decor & costumes\, spooky & kooky artists\, monsters/horror\, macabre\, weird stuff\, tarot\, character photo ops\, and more. We encourage everyone to dress in costumes! \n\n\n\n Saturday: 10am-11am | VIP Early Entry (ticket required) Saturday: 11am-4pm | $5 general admission (cash only at the door – 12 & under free)  Sunday: 10am-3pm | FREE admission Parking is free onsite.SPECIAL SPOOKY GUESTS: Saturday: Morticia & Gomez AddamsSunday: Jareth the Goblin King & Goblin Minion  \n\n\n\n VIP EARLY ENTRY IS SATURDAY ONLY! Advance VIP tickets on sale August 21. VIP tickets includes all-day admission\, exclusive access to shop the vendors before the general public\, and a Halloween tote bag.  \n\n\n\nFollow us on Facebook & Instagram @allhallowsflea for vendor previews and more information. Vendor application is waiting list only. \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/all-hallows-flea-3rd-annual-halloween-market/
LOCATION:Spooky Nook Sports\, 75 Champ Blvd\, Manheim\, PA\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Festivals & Annual Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/2026-all-hallows-flea-8.5-x-11-small-poster.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="All Hallows Flea":MAILTO:fortyelephants@yahoo.com
END:VEVENT
