SUMMARY:Ragtime the Musical
DESCRIPTION:A sweeping musical adaptation of E.L. Doctorow’s novel that follows three fictional families in pursuit of the American Dream at the dawn of the 20th Century: Black pianist Coalhouse Walker\, Jr. and his beloved Sarah\, Jewish immigrant Tateh and his little girl\, and a wealthy white family led by matriarch Mother. All grasping for the same dream\, if only they can hold on to it. \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Buy Tickets
