SUMMARY:Next Generation of Lancaster 2nd Clangin' For A Cause
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for an evening of learning\, networking\, and friendly competition! Designed to support our front-line crew and future leaders\, this event is all about growing together as an industry—while having a great time doing it. \n\n\n\nEvent Highlights: \n\n\n\n\nWashers Tournament: Play for a $1\,000 grand prize\, plus a matching $1\,000 donation to the winning team’s local charity of choice! (Check out some eligible local charities here).\n\n\n\nInspirational Keynote: Hear an empowering leadership message from Super Bowl Champion Todd Rucci!\n\n\n\nFood & Drinks: Enjoy a delicious Rocky’s BBQ dinner\, 2 drink tickets\, and plenty of complimentary soda and water.\n\n\n\n\nRegistration & Details: \n\n\n\n\nTournament Entry: $20 per 2-person team. Feel free to pair up with a co-worker\, family member\, or friend!\n\n\n\nSpectators Welcome: Not playing? Come join the fun and cheer on the teams!\n\n\n\nAttire: Show your pride and wear your company gear—whether you’re coming straight from the job site or the office.\n\n\n\n\nSpecial Thanks to Sponsors: Brubaker\, Inc. | J&J Companies | SWF Industrial | Kegel’s Produce | Manufacturing Network | Sahd Metal Recycling \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/next-generation-of-lancaster-2nd-clangin-for-a-cause/
LOCATION:J&J Companies\, 1820 Franklin St Columbia\, PA 17512\, Columbia\, PA\, 17512\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/07/Next-Gen-2nd-Annual-Clangin-For-A-Cause-Flyer.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Next Generation of Lancaster%2C PA":MAILTO:ej.pratt522@gmail.com
